{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-34","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Umwelt und Energie 4","bn":"পরিবেশ ও শক্তি ৪"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„trennen“ মানে কী?","options":["আলাদা করা","গরম করা","কমানো"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-34-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„heizen“ মানে কী?","options":["বাছাই করা","গরম করা","বাতাস চলাচল করানো"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-34-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Im Winter ___ wir die Wohnung. (গরম করা)","options":["lüften","senken","heizen"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-34-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Bitte ___ Sie das Zimmer jeden Morgen. (বাতাস চলাচল করানো)","options":["lüften","heizen","besitzen"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-34-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„entsorgen“ মানে কী?","options":["মালিক হওয়া","নিষ্পত্তি করা, ফেলে দেওয়া","তৈরি করা"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-34-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir müssen die Raumtemperatur ___. (কমানো)","options":["besitzen","betonen","senken"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-34-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„herstellen“ মানে কী?","options":["উৎপাদন করা","স্থাপন করা","হিসাব করে দেখানো"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-34-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir ___ den Müll in Papier, Glas und Plastik. (বাছাই করা)","options":["betreten","sortieren","heizen"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-34-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ging, ohne ___ zu verabschieden.","options":["ihn","zu","sich"],"answer":2,"explanation":"sich verabschieden → ohne sich zu verabschieden।","id":"b1-practice-34-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"কোন বাক্যটি সঠিক?","options":["Sie ging, ohne zu frühstückt.","Sie ging, ohne zu frühstücken.","Sie ging, ohne frühstücken."],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-34-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er kaufte das Handy, ohne den Preis zu fragen.“ মানে কী?","options":["সে দাম জিজ্ঞেস করে মোবাইলটা কিনল।","সে মোবাইল না কিনে দাম জিজ্ঞেস করল।","সে দাম জিজ্ঞেস না করেই মোবাইলটা কিনল।"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-34-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich fahre Rad, ___ fit zu bleiben.","options":["um","damit","ohne"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-34-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Luftverschmutzung“ মানে কী?","options":["ঘরের তাপমাত্রা","বায়ু দূষণ","জীবনের মান"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-34-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Nachdem wir den Müll getrennt ___, brachten wir ihn zur Mülltonne.","options":["haben","waren","hatten"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-34-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Solaranlage ___ letzte Woche montiert.","options":["wurde","wird","hat"],"answer":0,"explanation":"অতীতের Passiv।","id":"b1-practice-34-q15"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ kein Auto. Ich fahre immer mit dem Fahrrad. (মালিক হওয়া)","options":["belaste","besitze","betrete"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-34-q16"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir müssen den Müll ___. (কমানো)","options":["montieren","betreten","verringern"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-34-q17"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Bitte die Wiese nicht ___! (প্রবেশ করা)","options":["betreten","besitzen","sortieren"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-34-q18"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ali schreibt: „Mein Vater hat mir vorgerechnet, wie viel Geld wir sparen, wenn wir die Raumtemperatur um zwei Grad senken. Es sind fast 200 Euro im Jahr!“\nকী করলে বছরে প্রায় ২০০ ইউরো বাঁচে?","options":["গাড়ি কম চালালে","ঘরের তাপমাত্রা দুই ডিগ্রি কমালে","দুটো বাতি বন্ধ রাখলে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"die Raumtemperatur um zwei Grad senken।","id":"b1-practice-34-q19"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er hat den alten Kühlschrank entsorgt, ohne ihn zu ___, ___ er nicht wusste, dass er noch funktioniert.","options":["testen … obwohl","testet … weil","testen … weil"],"answer":2,"explanation":"ohne … zu + infinitive; কারণ → weil।","id":"b1-practice-34-q20"}],"requires":{"grammar":16,"vocabulary":17}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-34","level":"B1","test":[]}